Package: fastfetch
Name: fastfetch
Version: @DEB_FASTFETCH_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Author: Carter Li <https://github.com/fastfetch-cli/fastfetch>
Section: Utilities
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/fastfetch-cli/fastfetch
Description: System information, printed prettily
 Run `fastfetch` in a terminal to see your device, iOS version, uptime, memory,
 storage and more, laid out beside an Apple logo. Ready-made looks live in
 /usr/share/fastfetch; your own settings go in
 ~/.config/fastfetch/config.jsonc.
